      "strKey": "GAAQCAIBAEAQCAIBAEAQCAIBAEAQCAIBAEAQCAIBAEAQCAIBAEAQDZ7H",
      "derivation": "StrKey.encodeEd25519PublicKey(Buffer.alloc(32, 0x01))"
    },
    {
